  trashHints:
  - "Some people are so careless when walking through the forest... \xA7they just
    leave their stuff lying around. "
  - "Do you think people leave things in the forest for composting? Don\u2019t they
    know these things can take up to 450 years to decompose?% "
  - 'Some people drive by in their boats sometimes... % I think I saw them throw
    something overboard. What a shame. '
  - "I hope the seagulls don\u2019t try to eat that- they sometimes mistake it for
    crabs.\xA7 "
  - 'Once you start spotting them, you can''t stop. They are like weeds -everywhere.. '
  - "\xA7This does not belong in nature, but now I see it everywhere.... "
